      "machineHash": "7c97b9eeb0f49918a21e72900f1137b95a42e9121460ea691af278dbf43d249a",
      "machineText": "Wails 构建系统是一款灵活而强大的工具，旨在简化 Wails 应用程序的构建流程。它利用任务运行器[Task](https://taskfile.dev)，让你可以轻松定义和运行任务。虽然 v3 构建系统是默认选项，但 Wails 鼓励采用“自带工具”的方式，允许开发者根据需要自定义构建流程。",
      "status": "final",
      "sourcePreview": "The Wails build system is a flexible and powerful tool designed to streamline\\ the build process for…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-13T23:13:50Z"
    },
